WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 6

01:38.620 --> 01:39.390
Who is it?

01:39.410 --> 01:40.330
The girl from the Ye's who likes messing around

01:40.330 --> 01:41.530
from day to night.

01:41.620 --> 01:43.000
I remember her now.

01:43.050 --> 01:44.450
Is it the girl

01:44.450 --> 01:45.410
who gave you two cases of diamonds and jewelries

01:45.410 --> 01:46.430
every spring festival?

01:46.450 --> 01:47.640
No, not her!

01:47.820 --> 01:48.770
It's Ye Ling'er,

01:48.770 --> 01:50.600
the daughter of Chief Guard of the capital city.

01:50.620 --> 01:52.530
Just send her away!

01:52.620 --> 01:54.530
Ye Ling'er is not a big deal.

01:54.690 --> 01:57.310
I feel like she has other companies.

01:57.330 --> 01:58.600
Who else did you see?

01:58.620 --> 02:00.240
It's the carriage from the Fan mansion.

02:01.620 --> 02:03.450
I just saw Fan Ruoruo.

02:03.860 --> 02:05.220
The servant of the Fan mansion just said

02:05.220 --> 02:06.800
they left together.

02:06.820 --> 02:07.850
So Fan Xian must be

02:07.850 --> 02:09.400
on that carriage.

02:09.420 --> 02:10.060
Normally, Ye Ling'er

02:10.060 --> 02:11.270
would ride a horse on her own.

02:11.290 --> 02:13.400
How come she suddenly changes her habit

02:13.420 --> 02:14.970
and takes a carriage instead?

02:16.260 --> 02:17.450
Wait!

02:19.180 --> 02:19.700
It's probably

02:19.700 --> 02:21.330
the carriage of Princess Lin.

02:22.180 --> 02:23.690
Do keep quiet!

02:24.010 --> 02:26.280
Nobody can know that brother is not here.

02:29.180 --> 02:31.120
I'll get off to talk with him.

02:32.620 --> 02:34.340
You're coughing more seriously today.

02:34.340 --> 02:36.430
You can't afford to catch a cold.

02:36.450 --> 02:38.330
I'll ask him over.

02:52.730 --> 02:53.800
Lady Ye,

02:53.820 --> 02:55.190
long time no see.

02:55.210 --> 02:56.400
How are you recently?

02:56.420 --> 02:57.640
Lady Fan,

02:57.780 --> 02:58.980
I'm not here

02:58.980 --> 03:00.530
to chit-chat with you today.

03:00.850 --> 03:02.420
I heard that your brother in Danzhou

03:02.420 --> 03:04.000
has arrived in the capital city recently.

03:06.700 --> 03:09.120
I wonder if he's on that carriage right now.

03:09.900 --> 03:11.180
Lady Ye,

03:11.180 --> 03:12.880
why do you want to see my elder brother?

03:12.900 --> 03:14.430
Young Mater Fan, Princess Lin would like

03:14.450 --> 03:16.640
to see you.

03:20.420 --> 03:21.610
Gosh!

03:21.700 --> 03:23.710
It's really the carriage of Princess Lin.

03:23.730 --> 03:25.370
We're in big trouble now.

03:34.760 --> 03:36.480
=Investigator's Office=

03:36.490 --> 03:37.490
Is he insane?

03:37.490 --> 03:38.260
Quiet! Quiet!

03:38.260 --> 03:39.530
Let's go! Let's go!

04:00.090 --> 04:01.810
Ye Ling'er, don't be silly!

04:01.900 --> 04:03.880
Distinguished as Princess Lin,

04:03.900 --> 04:05.960
how can she meet my elder brother in private?

04:05.980 --> 04:08.370
Who's being silly? I'm...

04:12.490 --> 04:13.540
Lady Ruoruo,

04:13.540 --> 04:15.870
I want to talk with Mr. Fan.

04:15.890 --> 04:17.630
Just a few words.

04:17.650 --> 04:19.190
It won't take long.

04:19.210 --> 04:20.520
Just put the curtain down.

04:20.540 --> 04:21.970
You can't catch a cold.

04:28.140 --> 04:29.400
To tell you the truth.

04:29.420 --> 04:31.720
My brother caught a cold recently.

04:31.740 --> 04:33.070
And he's not recovered yet.

04:33.090 --> 04:35.190
Why don't we go back early today

04:35.210 --> 04:37.000
and talk another day?

04:37.020 --> 04:38.440
Mr. Fan, I beg your pardon.

04:38.460 --> 04:39.800
You're sick.

04:39.820 --> 04:41.690
I shouldn't interrupt you.

04:41.740 --> 04:43.000
But I must talk to you face to face

04:43.020 --> 04:45.600
to set things straight.

04:45.980 --> 04:49.320
Only a few words. Please get off and talk with me.

04:56.980 --> 04:58.850
Mr. Fan!

05:04.540 --> 05:06.250
Sister asked me to keep quiet.

05:06.930 --> 05:08.370
But if I do so,

05:08.370 --> 05:09.760
they'll find out that Fan Xian is not here.

05:09.860 --> 05:11.520
What if Fan Xian gets angry

05:11.540 --> 05:13.600
and stops me from selling the books?

05:13.700 --> 05:14.580
I can't lose

05:14.580 --> 05:16.040
my money!

05:20.210 --> 05:23.040
Your Highness?

05:26.020 --> 05:27.530
Sorry to interrupt.

05:29.050 --> 05:30.480
Whatever you want to say,

05:30.580 --> 05:32.760
let's talk next time.

05:33.170 --> 05:35.850
Just a few words. It won't take long.

05:37.140 --> 05:39.400
It's not convenient now.

05:39.420 --> 05:40.810
Not convenient?

05:42.210 --> 05:44.290
I met a singing girl

05:44.610 --> 05:45.090
when drinking

05:45.090 --> 05:47.120
a moment ago.

05:47.140 --> 05:48.070
Now

05:48.090 --> 05:49.810
she's on my carriage.

05:49.980 --> 05:52.440
Princess, how about coming to my mansion

05:52.460 --> 05:55.480
for a detailed discussion later?

05:56.300 --> 05:57.840
Fan Xian!

05:57.860 --> 05:59.140
How dare you!

05:59.140 --> 06:00.850
I'm gonna kick your ass!

06:03.330 --> 06:04.640
Ye Ling'er!

06:13.820 --> 06:16.530
My Lady, how come you coughed blood?

06:24.300 --> 06:25.640
Sorry for the interruption.

06:27.770 --> 06:29.410
Let's go!

06:51.740 --> 06:52.920
Speak!

06:53.020 --> 06:54.310
No?

06:54.330 --> 06:55.760
Being tough, huh?

06:55.930 --> 06:58.160
-Help! -Speak or not?

07:00.860 --> 07:02.440
Still keep your mouth shut?!

07:02.860 --> 07:04.690
Won't talk, huh?

07:05.260 --> 07:06.440
Beat him!

07:07.930 --> 07:09.590
We won't stop until you speak!

07:09.610 --> 07:11.630
-Help! -Drag him up!

07:11.650 --> 07:13.600
Speak or not?

07:14.700 --> 07:16.370
So stubborn!

07:16.610 --> 07:17.920
Speak!

07:18.260 --> 07:19.630
You ask for this!

07:19.650 --> 07:21.030
Help!

07:21.050 --> 07:22.640
Speak or not?

07:25.580 --> 07:26.800
Send more men.

07:26.820 --> 07:28.580
It should be one hundred more than usual.

07:28.580 --> 07:29.300
So awesome!

07:29.300 --> 07:29.770
Of course!

07:29.770 --> 07:30.420
Let me have a try!

07:30.420 --> 07:31.690
Let's go.

07:32.460 --> 07:33.650
Good! It's pretty heavy.

07:33.650 --> 07:35.160
Of course!

07:35.210 --> 07:36.370
So awesome!

07:40.090 --> 07:41.850
Excuse me!

07:42.260 --> 07:43.570
Excuse me!

07:45.980 --> 07:47.370
Excuse me!

07:53.540 --> 07:54.980
I'm Director-General of the Investigator's Office,

07:54.980 --> 07:56.330
and the student of Master Fei as well.

07:56.330 --> 07:58.130
Will anyone talk to me?

08:07.170 --> 08:08.880
The texture is correct.

08:09.860 --> 08:11.250
The stamp is correct.

08:12.490 --> 08:14.480
The pattern matches. It's real.

08:15.210 --> 08:17.720
Director-General, nice to meet you.

08:18.020 --> 08:18.910
Your Excellency!

08:18.930 --> 08:21.030
Master Fei is not in the capital now.

08:21.050 --> 08:22.120
I know.

08:22.140 --> 08:23.910
I'm here for a file.

08:23.930 --> 08:25.610
D No. 534.

08:25.610 --> 08:27.600
Your Excellency, please come with me.

08:54.850 --> 08:56.270
Have you got the information?

08:56.290 --> 08:57.350
Yes.

08:57.370 --> 08:59.080
Word has spread to the entire street.

08:59.260 --> 09:01.370
Fan Xian caused trouble the moment he went out.

09:01.800 --> 09:02.370
He bickered with Guo Baokun,

09:02.370 --> 09:03.340
the Imperial Compiler.

09:03.340 --> 09:04.840
And he even beat someone.

09:05.220 --> 09:06.240
Did he beat Guo Baokun?

09:06.260 --> 09:07.440
Not really.

09:07.460 --> 09:09.470
He only beat the guard of the Guo family.

09:09.490 --> 09:11.370
But it still shows that he's a hothead.

09:11.660 --> 09:12.710
Don't forget what just happened.

09:12.730 --> 09:14.710
How can he do such a nasty thing

09:14.730 --> 09:15.920
with his sister on the carriage.

09:17.780 --> 09:19.600
So improper!

09:21.260 --> 09:23.480
My Lady, please don't be angry.

09:25.970 --> 09:27.520
I'm not angry.

09:28.020 --> 09:29.370
I think

09:29.930 --> 09:30.970
there must be a trustworthy man

09:30.970 --> 09:32.810
in the world.

09:33.490 --> 09:36.770
I would rather die than marry a bad man.

09:38.530 --> 09:40.590
Right, there's another message.

09:40.610 --> 09:41.780
Prince Jing's son invited

09:41.780 --> 09:43.800
Fan Xian over for a poetry gathering tomorrow.

09:43.820 --> 09:45.280
A poetry gathering?

09:59.100 --> 10:01.880
Help! Help!

10:01.900 --> 10:03.020
This...

10:03.020 --> 10:04.120
Your Excellency, it's fine.

10:04.140 --> 10:05.530
It's just a condemned prisoner

10:05.530 --> 10:06.590
from the dungeon.

10:06.610 --> 10:08.720
Your Excellency, this way, please.

10:15.580 --> 10:16.350
Your Excellency,

10:16.370 --> 10:18.050
this place is guarded by Clerk.

10:18.050 --> 10:19.490
The files in the D section are not confidential.

10:19.490 --> 10:21.520
Feel free to ask him for it.

10:27.460 --> 10:28.690
Who's that?

10:28.970 --> 10:29.780
Wang Qinian!

10:29.780 --> 10:31.250
=Wang Qinian, Clerk of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=
Mr. Fan!

10:32.490 --> 10:33.770
No!

10:33.930 --> 10:35.960
You can leave. We'd like to talk in private.

10:46.340 --> 10:47.530
Mr. Wang, all these files

10:47.530 --> 10:49.220
are managed by you!

10:49.220 --> 10:52.690
You're really something!

10:53.260 --> 10:56.280
I'm just a clerk. It's no big deal.

10:57.020 --> 10:59.240
Busy as you are,

10:59.260 --> 11:01.330
how do you squeeze time to draw maps and sell books?

11:02.290 --> 11:03.610
But you must be

11:03.610 --> 11:05.560
exceptionally vigorous and resolute in work.

11:05.580 --> 11:06.510
And you run

11:06.530 --> 11:08.250
exceptionally fast.

11:09.780 --> 11:11.000
Mr. Fan,

11:11.020 --> 11:12.970
how can you enter

11:12.970 --> 11:14.650
the Investigation's Office?

11:17.370 --> 11:19.030
I've got a Director-General token here.

11:19.050 --> 11:19.970
Check it for me.

11:19.970 --> 11:21.960
I don't know whether it's true or not.

11:28.340 --> 11:29.810
Your Excellency!

11:29.930 --> 11:31.280
What are you doing?

11:31.410 --> 11:32.650
I know that

11:34.780 --> 11:36.570
I'm morally defected.

11:36.660 --> 11:39.150
Not only have I failed the masses,

11:39.170 --> 11:42.370
but I've failed Your Majesty.

11:42.490 --> 11:45.920
But I accumulate wealth in private

11:46.100 --> 11:48.370
only because terrible things

11:49.700 --> 11:52.160
have happened to our family.

11:52.700 --> 11:54.770
I'm really helpless.

11:55.530 --> 11:56.170
Just get up.

11:56.170 --> 11:57.260
I didn't ask you to kneel down.

11:57.260 --> 11:58.440
Your Excellency!

11:58.460 --> 12:00.640
My wife

12:00.660 --> 12:01.950
died early,

12:01.970 --> 12:03.570
only to leave a daughter

12:04.140 --> 12:06.450
in my care.

12:06.660 --> 12:08.480
My daughter

12:08.700 --> 12:10.650
also got an incurable disease.

12:11.580 --> 12:13.640
Countless expensive medicines

12:13.660 --> 12:15.370
were used,

12:15.610 --> 12:17.450
but nothing worked.

12:18.260 --> 12:20.370
Just a few days ago,

12:21.020 --> 12:22.480
my daughter

12:23.220 --> 12:25.830
also left me.

12:25.850 --> 12:27.450
Your Excellency!

12:27.490 --> 12:30.130
I've spent every penny

12:30.220 --> 12:32.770
to treat my wife and daughter.

12:33.260 --> 12:34.650
Now

12:35.020 --> 12:37.210
I sell maps and books,

12:38.050 --> 12:40.650
only to save money

12:41.290 --> 12:45.210
to bury my daughter.

12:46.290 --> 12:47.350
I see.

12:47.370 --> 12:49.600
Just get up.

12:49.850 --> 12:52.600
I'm so frightened.

12:52.970 --> 12:56.960
I feel so ashamed.

12:59.020 --> 13:00.690
Get up! Get up!

13:02.020 --> 13:03.130
Come on!

13:09.260 --> 13:10.560
Well, Wang.

13:10.580 --> 13:11.340
I ran into you wife

13:11.340 --> 13:12.590
on the street a moment ago.

13:12.610 --> 13:13.460
She asked you to buy vegetables only

13:13.460 --> 13:14.510
when you go back.

13:14.530 --> 13:15.460
She said your daughter

13:15.460 --> 13:16.730
doesn't feel well after eating too much meat recently.

13:16.730 --> 13:17.900
She can only eat vegetables for a few days.

13:17.900 --> 13:19.530
She also mentioned that
your daughter caught a cold last night.

13:19.530 --> 13:21.600
She asked you to buy
some medicine on your way home.

13:24.730 --> 13:29.040
My sincere feelings must have moved the God,

13:29.460 --> 13:31.210
so my wife and daughter

13:31.340 --> 13:33.770
are brought back to life!

13:48.820 --> 13:50.520
What else do you want to say?

13:53.780 --> 13:56.000
Your Excellency, look!

13:56.020 --> 13:58.510
The sugar-coated haws

13:58.530 --> 14:00.150
are so red and beautifully shaped.

14:00.170 --> 14:01.510
They're definitely yummy.

14:01.530 --> 14:03.030
Only such sugar-coated haws

14:03.050 --> 14:03.730
can match

14:03.730 --> 14:05.470
a charming young man like you.

14:05.490 --> 14:06.510
Just take it!

14:06.530 --> 14:07.920
Thank you, Your Excellency!

14:10.020 --> 14:11.200
Is it really worth it?

14:11.220 --> 14:12.270
For only two taels of silver,

14:12.290 --> 14:14.280
you actually cursed your wife and daughter to death.

14:14.700 --> 14:17.290
They are in good health.

14:17.290 --> 14:18.650
A few bad words won't hurt them.

14:18.780 --> 14:19.780
You're so greedy.

14:19.780 --> 14:21.470
Aren't you afraid it might ruin your reputation?

14:21.490 --> 14:22.510
Your Excellency.

14:22.530 --> 14:24.440
Reputation means nothing

14:24.460 --> 14:26.270
to me.

14:26.290 --> 14:28.390
Money, to me,

14:28.410 --> 14:30.400
is more important than my life.

14:30.530 --> 14:33.240
This is what I believe

14:33.260 --> 14:35.130
all along.

14:35.780 --> 14:36.970
You might actually

14:36.970 --> 14:38.240
get along with my younger brother.

14:38.260 --> 14:39.480
How about this?

14:39.850 --> 14:42.160
You don't have to give me back the two taels of silver.

14:42.220 --> 14:44.520
You are so generous.

14:44.700 --> 14:45.930
But you must

14:45.930 --> 14:47.320
stop selling books.

14:47.340 --> 14:48.640
Because I'm going to sell books.

14:48.660 --> 14:50.080
What do you say?

14:52.140 --> 14:53.840
I'll do it.

14:56.580 --> 14:59.080
OK. Let's get down to business.

14:59.100 --> 15:00.270
I'm here this time

15:00.290 --> 15:01.710
for two things.

15:01.730 --> 15:02.760
One is that

15:02.780 --> 15:03.220
I want to see

15:03.220 --> 15:05.370
File D No. 534.

15:05.490 --> 15:06.770
Your Excellency.

15:07.220 --> 15:08.840
This file is about

15:08.970 --> 15:11.640
Teng Zijing of the Fourth Division.

15:11.660 --> 15:13.280
You're actually good at your work.

15:13.820 --> 15:15.280
But

15:15.530 --> 15:17.830
Teng Zijing is dead.

15:17.850 --> 15:19.030
I know.

15:19.050 --> 15:20.370
I killed him.

15:22.370 --> 15:24.250
Can I have the file now?

15:26.610 --> 15:27.910
Your Excellency.

15:27.930 --> 15:29.490
There are many files

15:29.490 --> 15:30.800
in the D section.

15:30.820 --> 15:31.680
It takes time

15:31.700 --> 15:33.150
to find it.

15:33.170 --> 15:34.450
How about this?

15:34.490 --> 15:35.830
I'll find it first.

15:35.850 --> 15:36.970
Then tomorrow,

15:36.970 --> 15:38.900
I'll deliver it to your mansion in person.

15:38.900 --> 15:40.440
Is it OK?

15:40.460 --> 15:41.720
Fine.

15:42.290 --> 15:43.690
Let's talk about the second thing.

15:44.530 --> 15:46.240
Someone tried to assassinate me in Danzhou.

15:46.260 --> 15:47.950
You must have heard about it.

15:47.970 --> 15:49.130
Yes.

15:49.490 --> 15:50.910
The secret order was faked.

15:50.930 --> 15:52.320
Many people of the Fourth Division were
investigated and punished

15:52.340 --> 15:53.880
because of it.

15:53.900 --> 15:55.840
Who planned the whole thing to kill me?

15:56.730 --> 15:59.960
The one who gave out the fake order has killed himself.

16:00.050 --> 16:01.590
It was a scout of the Fourth Division.

16:01.610 --> 16:03.440
What's his name? Where did he live?

16:03.460 --> 16:04.510
Who did he usually contact?

16:04.530 --> 16:05.710
Your Excellency.

16:05.730 --> 16:06.950
This case

16:06.970 --> 16:08.830
was supervised by the Head himself.

16:08.850 --> 16:10.080
No one else can take part.

16:10.100 --> 16:11.720
Please forgive me for not being helpful.

16:13.170 --> 16:14.270
How about this?

16:14.290 --> 16:15.690
I just need a name.

16:19.370 --> 16:22.370
He is named Xu Yunzhang.

16:25.970 --> 16:27.270
Remember to deliver

16:27.290 --> 16:29.320
that file tomorrow.

16:29.340 --> 16:30.680
I see.

16:30.700 --> 16:32.410
Your Excellency only needs to

16:32.410 --> 16:33.830
wait at home.

16:33.850 --> 16:35.080
There's one more thing.

16:35.100 --> 16:36.890
My teacher told me something.

16:37.290 --> 16:38.140
When you arrive in the capital city,

16:38.140 --> 16:40.350
do visit the Investigator's Office.

16:40.370 --> 16:42.720
There's a stele there.

16:43.340 --> 16:44.600
Have a look at it.

16:44.900 --> 16:46.210
What stele?

16:47.100 --> 16:49.370
Don't you always want to know

16:50.050 --> 16:51.600
things about your mother.

16:52.700 --> 16:54.160
After seeing that stele,

16:54.660 --> 16:56.250
you'll get to know her.

16:56.580 --> 16:58.260
Where's the stele

16:58.260 --> 16:59.800
he has mentioned?

16:59.820 --> 17:01.610
There's only one stele here.

17:01.610 --> 17:03.330
It's outside the front door.

17:03.370 --> 17:04.680
Outside?

17:05.740 --> 17:06.960
According to the Head,

17:06.980 --> 17:09.050
the stele inscriptions show the original intention of

17:09.050 --> 17:10.510
establishing the Investigator's Office.

17:10.530 --> 17:12.320
OK. I'll check that out.

17:12.340 --> 17:13.650
You can go back.

17:43.530 --> 17:45.480
I hope that laws of Nanqing

17:45.890 --> 17:47.650
are made for the common people.

17:48.010 --> 17:49.960
The noble shall not be tolerated,

17:50.530 --> 17:52.600
and the poor shall not be suppressed.

17:53.130 --> 17:54.930
No people shall be wronged,

17:55.290 --> 17:57.320
and no sin shall be imposed.

17:58.340 --> 18:00.890
Practice the law is like wielding a sword.

18:01.250 --> 18:03.230
wipe out demons and monsters

18:03.250 --> 18:04.840
without asking the God for help.

18:07.890 --> 18:10.270
I hope that the people of Nanqing

18:10.290 --> 18:12.560
seek truth,

18:12.980 --> 18:16.650
know etiquette and remain kind.

18:17.170 --> 18:19.630
Never measure success by wealth.

18:19.650 --> 18:21.840
Never yield to power and influence.

18:22.250 --> 18:26.290
Pity the weak and detest injustice.

18:26.380 --> 18:28.800
Hold strong beliefs in difficult times.

18:28.980 --> 18:32.370
Introspect often when no one's watching.

18:44.410 --> 18:46.170
I hope there's no suppression

18:46.170 --> 18:48.480
and constraint in the world.

18:48.620 --> 18:50.360
Anyone born to the world

18:50.380 --> 18:52.840
has the right to live,

18:52.930 --> 18:54.930
feel free

18:55.530 --> 18:58.680
and be happy.

19:15.580 --> 19:17.480
I hope that one day,

19:17.770 --> 19:20.130
all man are born equal

19:20.220 --> 19:22.410
with no distinction of nobleness and lowliness.

19:23.170 --> 19:24.870
Guarding life

19:24.890 --> 19:26.510
and pursuing light,

19:26.530 --> 19:28.870
that's what I want.

19:28.890 --> 19:30.740
However difficult it might be,

19:30.740 --> 19:32.770
I'll move forward fearlessly.

19:33.340 --> 19:35.530
Men are born equal.

19:35.930 --> 19:38.130
Everyone is his own master.

20:09.220 --> 20:12.200
You actually wanted to change an entire era.

20:12.700 --> 20:14.960
What a grand aspiration!

20:15.010 --> 20:17.130
What a difficult dream to pursue!

20:18.500 --> 20:21.010
Today, I finally understand

20:21.010 --> 20:23.800
why you were killed.

20:31.740 --> 20:32.410
But I can't

20:32.410 --> 20:33.930
inherit your dream.

20:34.410 --> 20:36.130
I don't have the courage

20:36.250 --> 20:38.600
to go against the world.

20:44.700 --> 20:48.200
I just want to live my life.

20:49.290 --> 20:50.890
I'm so sorry.

21:01.770 --> 21:04.030
Your Majesty, we just got the information

21:04.050 --> 21:06.510
that Fan Xian went to the Investigator's Office secretly.

21:06.530 --> 21:07.960
He asked for a file

21:07.980 --> 21:08.890
and inquired about

21:08.890 --> 21:11.130
the real killer of the Danzhou assassination.

21:11.620 --> 21:14.200
He asked for file D No. 534.

21:14.220 --> 21:15.990
I had it copied and delivered.

21:16.010 --> 21:17.720
It's the file of Teng Zijing.

21:17.740 --> 21:19.410
He's a member of the Investigator's Office.

21:19.580 --> 21:21.150
He assassinated Fan Xian in Danzhou,

21:21.170 --> 21:23.230
but was killed by Fan Xian instead.

21:23.250 --> 21:25.320
It's weird.

21:25.340 --> 21:26.750
He's dead.

21:26.770 --> 21:29.440
Why did Fan Xian ask for the file?

21:29.500 --> 21:31.410
He's still alive.

21:31.740 --> 21:33.530
But the Investigator's Office reported

21:33.530 --> 21:35.200
he was killed in Danzhou.

21:35.220 --> 21:38.530
He came back to the capital city with Fan Xian.

21:40.220 --> 21:42.600
Your Majesty, you've already known it.

21:43.050 --> 21:44.320
In that sense,

21:44.340 --> 21:47.170
Fan Xian has lied to Your Majesty.

21:47.620 --> 21:49.530
Most of the people

21:49.770 --> 21:51.750
have lied to me.

21:51.770 --> 21:52.770
Your Majesty, does that mean

21:52.770 --> 21:55.250
you want to carry out a thorough investigation?

21:56.100 --> 21:57.680
As long as one can get his work done,

21:57.930 --> 22:01.290
it's OK for him to tell some lies.

22:01.980 --> 22:02.630
Your Majesty,

22:02.650 --> 22:05.320
you are too merciful!

22:05.930 --> 22:09.800
Will Fan Xian attend the poetry gathering tomorrow?

22:09.820 --> 22:11.130
Yes, he will.

22:11.770 --> 22:12.870
What about Chengze?

22:12.890 --> 22:16.110
Second Price did go to

22:16.130 --> 22:17.680
the Yishi House.

22:19.530 --> 22:20.560
What about the Eastern Palace?

22:20.580 --> 22:24.030
He's been spreading the word about

22:24.050 --> 22:26.600
how Fan Xian beat the guard
of the Guo family right on the street.

22:29.460 --> 22:31.770
Good for him.

22:32.860 --> 22:34.170
Your Highness!

22:34.460 --> 22:37.530
=Guo Baokun, son of Guo Youzhi, Minister of the Board of Rites of Nanqing=
Fan Xian only beat a guard.

22:37.820 --> 22:38.870
Even if the word do spread,

22:38.890 --> 22:40.560
he won't be declared guilty.

22:40.580 --> 22:41.220
To him,

22:41.220 --> 22:43.050
it's no big deal.

22:44.930 --> 22:46.360
He won't be declared guilty,

22:46.380 --> 22:48.220
but his morality will be questioned.

22:48.220 --> 22:49.500
Even if the whole city

22:49.500 --> 22:51.250
knows about his misconduct,

22:51.500 --> 22:54.110
there will only be gossips.

22:54.130 --> 22:56.680
Fan Xian just came to the capital city.

22:56.700 --> 22:58.560
He has no connection or reputation.

22:58.580 --> 23:00.080
But Wan'er,

23:00.100 --> 23:01.050
though not announced publicly,

23:01.050 --> 23:03.270
is the Prime Minister's daughter after all.

23:03.290 --> 23:04.980
If she is married to a notorious trash

23:04.980 --> 23:06.840
with no talent and morality,

23:07.050 --> 23:08.130
how embarrassed

23:08.130 --> 23:09.770
will the Prime Minister be!

23:10.860 --> 23:12.650
Destroy him completely.

23:14.980 --> 23:17.650
Your Highness, it's so brilliant!

23:18.500 --> 23:20.680
It's my aunt's idea.

23:20.860 --> 23:22.440
But to me,

23:23.500 --> 23:25.370
it's a little bit rushed.

23:25.980 --> 23:27.930
So you're not completely for it.

23:30.500 --> 23:31.870
No need to feel struggled.

23:31.890 --> 23:33.770
She wants to do me good.

23:33.890 --> 23:35.290
Then,

23:35.340 --> 23:38.080
let's see how the Prime Minister will deal with it.

23:45.930 --> 23:48.410
In your opinion,

23:48.410 --> 23:51.170
what will the Prime Minister do about the marriage?

23:51.380 --> 23:52.700
He'll ask Your Majesty to take back your order.

23:52.700 --> 23:53.990
Besides that,

23:54.010 --> 23:55.930
he has no other option.

23:57.700 --> 24:00.380
Your Majesty, the Prime Minister asks to see you.

24:00.380 --> 24:01.770
Let him in!

24:04.100 --> 24:05.800
Let the Prime Minister in!

24:05.820 --> 24:09.560
Let the Prime Minister in!

24:21.930 --> 24:24.800
=Lin Ruofu, the Prime Minister of Nanqing.=
Your Majesty, sorry to interrupt you.

24:24.820 --> 24:26.370
Prime Minister, please rise!

24:34.580 --> 24:35.960
You've done a good job.

24:35.980 --> 24:38.600
I dare not slack off
when it comes to the national affairs.

24:38.860 --> 24:40.170
OK.

24:44.700 --> 24:47.130
Do you have any other memorial?

24:48.930 --> 24:49.820
No, I don't.

24:49.820 --> 24:50.990
Then find a sedan

24:51.010 --> 24:52.270
to send the Prime Minister home.

24:52.290 --> 24:53.150
Yes.

24:53.170 --> 24:54.410
Wait!

24:54.650 --> 24:57.080
Old and weak as I am,

24:57.220 --> 24:59.720
I feel tired after walking a few steps.

25:00.170 --> 25:02.410
May I ask for a cup of tea?

25:04.460 --> 25:05.890
Take a seat.

25:06.620 --> 25:07.250
Get him some tea.

25:07.250 --> 25:08.930
Thank you, Your Majesty.

25:09.010 --> 25:10.720
Tea, please.

25:23.410 --> 25:25.170
Eunuch Hou.

25:25.340 --> 25:27.440
Don't you see the fire is about to go out?

25:27.460 --> 25:28.930
Yes.

25:46.580 --> 25:48.320
I just

25:48.340 --> 25:50.480
got a secret report,

25:50.820 --> 25:52.320
saying that Fan Xian

25:52.340 --> 25:53.740
caused trouble again

25:53.740 --> 25:55.030
in front of Yishi House.

25:55.050 --> 25:57.580
He beat the guard of the Guo family.

25:57.580 --> 25:59.150
Which Guo family?

25:59.170 --> 26:00.680
Guo Youzhi's family.

26:03.860 --> 26:06.250
I see.

26:06.620 --> 26:08.230
Government officials and the common people

26:08.250 --> 26:11.800
all think Fan Xian

26:12.220 --> 26:14.290
as rude and immoral.

26:14.740 --> 26:16.680
Prime Minister, what do you think?

26:18.770 --> 26:20.320
Well.

26:23.770 --> 26:27.840
I'm afraid it's wrong.

26:29.740 --> 26:30.720
Why?

26:30.740 --> 26:33.200
He's an ardent young man.

26:33.820 --> 26:35.910
He might cause some trouble,

26:35.930 --> 26:37.800
but it's no big deal.

26:38.410 --> 26:41.320
I firmly believe that given time,

26:41.340 --> 26:44.930
Fan Xian is sure to display his talent

26:44.930 --> 26:46.600
and make a name in the capital city.

26:46.620 --> 26:48.560
You really think so?

26:48.580 --> 26:51.290
Your Majesty, I trust you.

26:51.620 --> 26:54.110
You are the one

26:54.130 --> 26:56.010
who approved their marriage.

27:02.740 --> 27:05.930
Insightful as you are,

27:06.500 --> 27:09.010
how can misjudge a man?

27:11.500 --> 27:15.010
I heard that Fan Xian will
attend the poetry gathering

27:15.050 --> 27:16.930
held in King Jing's mansion.

27:16.980 --> 27:20.840
I firmly believe Your Majesty's judgment.

27:21.250 --> 27:24.630
Fan Xian is sure to
make his name in the capital city

27:24.650 --> 27:26.530
with his literary accomplishments.

27:28.410 --> 27:29.410
I'm actually looking forward to it

27:29.410 --> 27:31.650
after hearing your words.

27:32.860 --> 27:34.440
Stay seated! Don't get up!

27:34.460 --> 27:35.320
Prime Minister.

27:35.340 --> 27:38.720
Your Majesty, I've finished my tea.

27:38.740 --> 27:40.320
And I've had enough rest.

27:40.340 --> 27:44.800
Then feel free to leave.

27:45.130 --> 27:46.560
I'll see myself out

27:46.580 --> 27:48.390
if there's nothing else.

27:48.410 --> 27:49.800
Escort the Prime Minister out.

27:56.220 --> 27:58.250
Such a cunning fox!

27:58.410 --> 28:01.130
Your Majesty, the Prime Minister has decided to

28:01.130 --> 28:03.080
support Fan Xian, right?

28:03.100 --> 28:04.980
What he just meant

28:04.980 --> 28:06.220
is that

28:06.220 --> 28:09.110
Fan Xian is picked by Your Majesty.

28:09.130 --> 28:11.720
If he's really morally deficient,

28:11.740 --> 28:14.230
then Your Majesty have picked the wrong man.

28:14.250 --> 28:16.510
If the marriage needs to be cancelled,

28:16.530 --> 28:19.600
then you have to bring it up.

28:21.170 --> 28:23.600
He's pushing me!

28:31.050 --> 28:32.480
I've made inquiries.

28:32.500 --> 28:33.770
Fan Xian was never taught

28:33.770 --> 28:35.390
by renowned masters in Danzhou.

28:35.410 --> 28:37.910
Nor did he write any poems.

28:37.930 --> 28:39.360
So the poetry gathering tomorrow

28:39.380 --> 28:41.250
is a perfect chance to suppress him.

28:41.860 --> 28:42.840
How can he

28:42.860 --> 28:43.500
write anything marvelous

28:43.500 --> 28:45.320
overnight?

28:45.340 --> 28:46.960
Once we win the poetry gathering tomorrow,

28:46.980 --> 28:48.010
we'll spread the word that

28:48.010 --> 28:49.220
he's rude and dumb

28:49.220 --> 28:50.840
with no morality or talent.

28:50.860 --> 28:52.080
Self-dignified as the Prime Minister is,

28:52.100 --> 28:53.510
he certainly won't marry Wan'er

28:53.530 --> 28:55.390
to such a joke like him.

28:55.410 --> 28:57.410
Your Highness, you're really resourceful!

29:00.500 --> 29:02.080
However, you must defeat him

29:02.770 --> 29:04.560
in the poetry gathering tomorrow.

29:04.820 --> 29:06.630
Your Highness, I've studied poetry since childhood.

29:06.650 --> 29:08.030
No need to worry.

29:08.050 --> 29:10.030
Moreover, today, before the Yishi House,

29:10.050 --> 29:11.360
I got acquainted with He Zongwei,

29:11.380 --> 29:12.200
the famous poet in the capital city.

29:12.220 --> 29:14.030
I'll go with him tomorrow.

29:14.050 --> 29:15.620
I'll make sure that Fan Xian is defeated

29:15.620 --> 29:16.930
and ashamed.

29:17.700 --> 29:19.110
I just don't get it.

29:19.130 --> 29:21.600
He actually agreed to attend the poetry gathering.

29:21.620 --> 29:24.200
Does he want to make a great coup?

29:26.250 --> 29:27.440
I care nothing about the poetry gathering.

29:27.460 --> 29:29.130
I mainly go there to see girls.

29:29.290 --> 29:30.510
Girls?

29:30.530 --> 29:31.010
I heard many female scholars

29:31.010 --> 29:32.800
will attend the gathering.

29:32.930 --> 29:33.990
That's true.

29:34.010 --> 29:35.580
Many female scholars

29:35.580 --> 29:36.990
do like to attend the poetry gathering.

29:37.010 --> 29:39.440
Brother, which girl are you looking for?

29:39.460 --> 29:41.680
My Lady Drumstick.

29:42.170 --> 29:43.530
Drumstick?

29:44.100 --> 29:45.840
Such a weird name.

29:53.100 --> 29:55.320
It refers to a real drumstick.

29:56.860 --> 29:58.680
Lend me a box.

30:03.010 --> 30:04.320
Did you bring it back yesterday?

30:04.340 --> 30:05.560
Yes. The same drumstick.

30:06.010 --> 30:07.360
Why do you keep it?

30:07.380 --> 30:09.290
It's a love token.

30:12.500 --> 30:14.050
It stinks.

30:15.770 --> 30:16.720
Brother.

30:16.740 --> 30:18.510
Aren't you just back yesterday?

30:18.530 --> 30:20.290
How come you're in love already?

30:20.460 --> 30:22.390
And the token

30:22.410 --> 30:24.650
is so

30:25.130 --> 30:26.390
special.

30:26.410 --> 30:27.990
Yesterday before I got back,

30:28.010 --> 30:29.170
I went to the Qing Temple.

30:29.170 --> 30:31.200
Why did you go there? It's not on your way home.

30:31.220 --> 30:32.290
You should ask that driver.

30:32.290 --> 30:33.110
How could I know?

30:33.130 --> 30:33.910
Then what?

30:33.930 --> 30:35.480
Then under the censer table

30:35.500 --> 30:37.080
in the side palace hall of the Qing Temple,

30:38.100 --> 30:39.800
I met her.

30:41.250 --> 30:44.770
Under the censer table?

30:45.890 --> 30:48.600
For me, I never believe in God.

30:48.700 --> 30:50.560
If there really is a divine temple,

30:50.580 --> 30:51.930
please do send down an envoy

30:51.930 --> 30:53.270
to explain to me.

30:53.290 --> 30:54.510
If you give me the answer,

30:54.530 --> 30:55.410
I will do you the favor of

30:55.410 --> 30:56.770
believing in you.

31:04.860 --> 31:06.290
Who is she?

31:06.380 --> 31:07.630
I forgot to ask her.

31:07.650 --> 31:09.630
How come you forgot to ask
the most important thing?

31:09.650 --> 31:11.370
I just forgot.

31:11.620 --> 31:12.910
At first, I thought

31:12.930 --> 31:14.340
maybe we're not meant for each other.

31:14.340 --> 31:15.870
Just let it go.

31:15.890 --> 31:17.680
But I can't.

31:17.770 --> 31:18.460
Last night,

31:18.460 --> 31:20.410
I dreamed of her several times.

31:20.770 --> 31:22.390
Although we didn't talk much,

31:22.410 --> 31:24.290
I just can't help thinking about her.

31:24.820 --> 31:26.800
We must find her.

31:27.740 --> 31:29.800
She might be at the poetry gathering tomorrow.

31:29.820 --> 31:30.840
I have to go there.

31:30.860 --> 31:32.990
I'll go with you tomorrow.

31:33.010 --> 31:33.870
If she's there,

31:33.890 --> 31:35.150
I'll ask her name for you.

31:35.170 --> 31:36.440
If she's not there,

31:36.460 --> 31:38.360
I'll visit all the mansions one by one.

31:38.380 --> 31:39.560
I will definitely find her for you!

31:39.580 --> 31:40.170
How are you

31:40.170 --> 31:41.720
more anxious than I am?

31:41.740 --> 31:43.440
Brother, you know what?

31:43.460 --> 31:43.980
This is

31:43.980 --> 31:45.890
what you called

31:46.100 --> 31:47.480
romantic.

31:47.820 --> 31:50.200
So it not only exists in stories,

31:50.250 --> 31:52.080
but in real life as well.

31:52.250 --> 31:54.130
We must find her!

31:57.700 --> 31:59.740
Brother, but Your Majesty

31:59.740 --> 32:01.530
has appointed a marriage for you.

32:06.460 --> 32:08.910
Destiny is so marvelous.

32:08.930 --> 32:11.250
Will it be possible that

32:11.460 --> 32:12.840
Lady Drumstick

32:12.860 --> 32:14.680
is actually Lin Wan'er?

32:14.700 --> 32:16.170
Impossible.

32:17.530 --> 32:20.200
Princess Lin is sick.

32:20.250 --> 32:22.270
I heard she can't eat any meat or fish.

32:22.290 --> 32:23.800
So she can't eat the drumstick

32:23.820 --> 32:25.680
or go out for a trip.

32:27.130 --> 32:28.680
What's wrong with her?

32:29.380 --> 32:30.600
I've no idea.

32:30.620 --> 32:31.600
It doesn't matter.

32:31.620 --> 32:34.290
What matters now is to
find my Sister-in-law Drumstick.

32:34.380 --> 32:36.010
Lady Drumstick sounds fine,

32:36.010 --> 32:36.820
but Sister-in-law Drumstick

32:36.820 --> 32:38.390
is not so good.

32:38.410 --> 32:40.650
Well, I shall look for her right away!

32:40.860 --> 32:42.460
Be patient! You've never seen her.

32:42.460 --> 32:44.370
You won't recognize her even if you see her.

32:45.820 --> 32:47.560
That's true.

32:51.130 --> 32:53.010
I'm so envious of you.

32:53.250 --> 32:54.360
You live your lives

32:54.380 --> 32:56.370
as stories.

33:01.250 --> 33:03.390
You'll meet your Mr. Right in future.

33:03.410 --> 33:04.800
Me?

33:05.530 --> 33:08.200
I won't! It's too hard for me!

33:09.820 --> 33:11.360
In future, my marriage

33:11.380 --> 33:13.080
is sure to be decided by dad.

33:13.100 --> 33:14.080
Definitely not!

33:14.100 --> 33:16.130
You must decide it yourself.

33:16.290 --> 33:18.270
Life's short.

33:18.290 --> 33:19.050
If you marry someone

33:19.050 --> 33:20.370
you don't like,

33:20.410 --> 33:22.080
what's the fun of it.

33:22.170 --> 33:23.410
But for girls, marriage

33:23.410 --> 33:24.290
is usually decided by parents.

33:24.290 --> 33:25.360
I don't care about others.

33:25.380 --> 33:26.840
You're different.

33:27.650 --> 33:28.870
Ruoruo,

33:28.890 --> 33:30.030
whoever you like,

33:30.050 --> 33:31.170
I'll get him for you

33:31.170 --> 33:32.510
no matter how hard it might be.

33:32.530 --> 33:33.440
As to the rest of the family,

33:33.460 --> 33:35.410
don't worry. I'll handle them.

33:37.290 --> 33:39.560
Thank you, brother.

33:40.010 --> 33:41.480
You're so kind to me.

33:42.500 --> 33:43.320
Because I only have

33:43.340 --> 33:45.290
one sister!

33:47.410 --> 33:50.150
Well, where's Teng Zijing?

33:50.170 --> 33:51.720
I need to talk with him.

33:53.410 --> 33:55.170
What's wrong?

33:55.220 --> 33:56.390
I forgot.

33:56.410 --> 33:57.250
I waited for you here

33:57.250 --> 33:58.870
to tell you something.

33:58.890 --> 34:00.440
Teng Zijing was caught by dad

34:00.460 --> 34:02.080
the moment he arrived at our mansion.

34:02.100 --> 34:04.560
Now he's locked up in the backyard.

34:04.700 --> 34:06.080
Why did dad catch him?

34:06.500 --> 34:07.510
I don't know.

34:07.530 --> 34:09.420
Also, Fan Sizhe is kneeling

34:09.420 --> 34:11.270
in front of the study.

34:11.290 --> 34:12.100
How is Fan Sizhe

34:12.100 --> 34:13.190
involved in this?

34:13.210 --> 34:14.660
Dad suspects that

34:14.660 --> 34:15.820
he incited you

34:15.820 --> 34:17.360
to fight with Guo Baokun,

34:17.380 --> 34:18.950
so that you and the Crown Prince will be enemies.

34:18.970 --> 34:19.660
Can Fan Sizhe

34:19.660 --> 34:21.280
be so cunning?

34:22.180 --> 34:23.880
He can't,

34:23.900 --> 34:25.120
but his mother can.

34:25.140 --> 34:26.600
It's a common scheme used

34:26.620 --> 34:29.320
when competing for family properties.

34:29.340 --> 34:30.600
Is there any evidence?

34:31.490 --> 34:32.840
No.

34:33.420 --> 34:34.210
OK. I see.

34:34.210 --> 34:35.030
Just wait here.

34:35.050 --> 34:36.450
I'll handle it.

34:42.180 --> 34:43.750
Look at you!

34:43.770 --> 34:45.470
One is caught, and the other is kneeling.

34:45.490 --> 34:46.840
Why didn't you tell me first?

34:48.420 --> 34:50.000
Your IQ is as low as a basin.

34:51.820 --> 34:53.490
IQ... basin.

34:54.820 --> 34:59.520
What is IQ, and what is a basin?

35:16.530 --> 35:17.970
Does it hurt?

35:21.530 --> 35:22.890
Get up.

35:23.250 --> 35:26.270
Dad asked me to kneel. I dare not get up!

35:26.290 --> 35:27.800
I'll talk to him.

35:28.210 --> 35:29.800
What can you say?

35:39.620 --> 35:41.750
Madam, Fan Xian is back.

35:41.770 --> 35:42.600
Where is he?

35:42.620 --> 35:44.470
He has gone to Master's study.

35:44.490 --> 35:47.800
Madam, Young Master is still on his knees.

35:47.820 --> 35:49.340
Just ask Master

35:49.340 --> 35:50.800
for mercy.

35:50.900 --> 35:52.690
Now, Fan Xian is the only one

35:53.140 --> 35:56.280
who can save Sizhe.

35:57.250 --> 35:58.100
Father.

35:58.100 --> 35:59.650
Where have you been?

36:01.820 --> 36:03.170
The Investigator's Office.

36:03.250 --> 36:04.560
Why did you go there?

36:04.580 --> 36:06.800
To see the stele left by my mom.

36:07.490 --> 36:10.490
Did she say those words?

36:11.340 --> 36:12.650
Yes.

36:13.900 --> 36:17.120
That's the original intention of
establishing the Investigator's Office.

36:17.140 --> 36:18.670
I can still remember

36:18.690 --> 36:21.450
the look on her face when she said those words.

36:22.050 --> 36:23.050
I've never heard of

36:23.050 --> 36:24.530
such a great dream!

36:24.530 --> 36:26.080
It's also unrealistic.

36:26.100 --> 36:29.640
You mom wanted to change the whole world.

36:29.660 --> 36:31.730
That stele is covered with dust.

36:31.770 --> 36:33.890
It's been forgotten for a long time.

36:39.050 --> 36:41.410
Well, forget it.

36:42.100 --> 36:43.650
I'm here to ask you

36:43.860 --> 36:46.000
why is Fan Sizhe kneeling outside.

36:53.140 --> 36:53.860
Don't make a sound. Don't talk.

36:53.860 --> 36:54.970
Don't ask me.

36:58.100 --> 36:59.930
Mom, why are you here?

37:00.180 --> 37:05.170
Prince Jing's son supports the second prince,

37:05.900 --> 37:10.000
while Guo Baokun supports the Crown Prince.

37:10.290 --> 37:11.670
You've told me

37:11.690 --> 37:13.400
the second prince is also competing for the throne.

37:13.420 --> 37:14.510
Exactly.

37:14.530 --> 37:16.230
So the two

37:16.250 --> 37:18.930
are incompatible as water and fire.

37:18.970 --> 37:20.990
You fought with Guo Baokun

37:21.010 --> 37:21.730
and will attend

37:21.730 --> 37:23.840
the poetry gathering held by Prince Jing's son.

37:23.860 --> 37:25.650
To others,

37:26.050 --> 37:28.240
you've chosen to support the second prince.

37:29.140 --> 37:30.880
It's a big deal.

37:30.900 --> 37:34.080
The Crown Prince won't tolerate it.

37:34.100 --> 37:36.320
Anyway, the Crown Prince won't like me.

37:36.340 --> 37:38.370
Just let Fan Sizhe get up.

37:41.180 --> 37:42.970
What a coincidence!

37:43.770 --> 37:45.670
He took you to the Yishi House.

37:45.690 --> 37:48.080
Then you got into a fight
with Guo Baokun right away.

37:48.100 --> 37:51.800
And then Prince Jing's son showed up just in time.

37:52.100 --> 37:53.400
I also find it coincidental.

37:53.420 --> 37:54.880
So I suspect that

37:54.900 --> 37:56.450
the Crown Prince and the second prince

37:56.450 --> 37:57.600
had us followed all along.

37:57.620 --> 37:59.730
It's also possible that

38:00.250 --> 38:03.430
Fan Sizhe set the trap deliberately.

38:03.450 --> 38:05.030
Impossible!

38:05.050 --> 38:05.530
Fan Sizhe didn't

38:05.530 --> 38:07.450
do this.

38:07.620 --> 38:09.250
You really trust him?

38:09.250 --> 38:10.360
The best idea

38:10.380 --> 38:11.760
he could come up with is to beat me up.

38:11.820 --> 38:13.400
He couldn't figure out

38:13.420 --> 38:14.800
such a complicated trap.

38:17.820 --> 38:19.280
What about his mother?

38:20.010 --> 38:21.750
She's capable of that.

38:21.770 --> 38:22.950
But father,

38:22.970 --> 38:24.360
let's be honest.

38:24.380 --> 38:25.690
If she comes up with such a sophisticated scheme,

38:25.690 --> 38:26.750
will she send Fan Sizhe

38:26.770 --> 38:28.840
to execute it?

38:28.970 --> 38:30.510
No way.

38:30.530 --> 38:31.430
I'm telling you!

38:31.450 --> 38:32.510
If there's a banana hanging on the beam,

38:32.530 --> 38:33.290
Fan Sizhe might not be able to

38:33.290 --> 38:34.450
get it down.

38:36.420 --> 38:37.690
Fine.

38:43.010 --> 38:44.920
If you choose to believe him,

38:44.940 --> 38:46.640
then he can get up.

38:46.660 --> 38:48.320
You should apologize to him.

38:51.420 --> 38:53.080
You put him on his knees for so long

38:53.100 --> 38:54.840
with no evidence.

38:54.860 --> 38:55.660
Don't you think

38:55.660 --> 38:57.130
you're too hard on him?

38:57.450 --> 39:00.190
He's disappointed me for so many times.

39:00.210 --> 39:01.690
How?

39:02.380 --> 39:04.430
He's neither adept with pen or the sword.

39:04.450 --> 39:06.710
He idles about every day.

39:06.730 --> 39:09.470
He's really good for nothing!

39:09.490 --> 39:11.280
Fan Sizhe is money-mad indeed.

39:11.660 --> 39:13.370
But have you ever wondered why?

39:15.290 --> 39:17.000
Here you are.

39:20.900 --> 39:22.270
I've asked Ruoruo about him.

39:22.290 --> 39:24.230
He never indulged himself in

39:24.250 --> 39:25.950
a dissipated life.

39:25.970 --> 39:27.840
Then why is he money-mad?

39:28.100 --> 39:29.120
Moreover,

39:29.140 --> 39:30.670
he's good at something.

39:30.690 --> 39:32.800
He's gifted in

39:32.820 --> 39:34.560
business and financial accounting.

39:34.580 --> 39:35.530
But

39:35.530 --> 39:37.660
those are not the right ways.

39:37.660 --> 39:39.100
Right or not, let's put that aside for now.

39:39.100 --> 39:40.520
I'm asking

39:41.180 --> 39:42.880
why is he

39:42.900 --> 39:44.600
money-mad?

39:47.050 --> 39:48.840
You know why?

39:48.860 --> 39:50.560
Because you are the Assistant Minister
of Ministry of Revenue,

39:50.580 --> 39:52.450
who is in charge of the world wealth.

39:52.970 --> 39:54.360
How is that relevant?

39:54.380 --> 39:55.320
In the Yishi House,

39:55.340 --> 39:56.180
at first Fan Sizhe

39:56.180 --> 39:57.430
just bickered with others.

39:57.450 --> 39:58.340
He didn't make a punch

39:58.340 --> 39:59.600
until Guo Baokun said something disrespectful

39:59.620 --> 40:01.560
about you.

40:02.420 --> 40:03.760
In his heart,

40:03.820 --> 40:05.760
he admires you the most.

40:19.340 --> 40:21.760
Mom, what have you heard?

40:24.250 --> 40:25.560
You are the Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue,

40:25.580 --> 40:27.650
so he is obsessed with business.

40:28.140 --> 40:29.920
He might not know himself that

40:29.940 --> 40:31.670
he's made all the efforts

40:31.690 --> 40:32.620
because he wants to help you

40:32.620 --> 40:34.370
subconsciously.

40:35.420 --> 40:36.920
The one kneeling outside

40:36.940 --> 40:38.490
is your son.

40:38.860 --> 40:40.930
You might find him useless.

40:41.100 --> 40:42.840
But he's done everything

40:42.860 --> 40:43.770
to gain

40:43.770 --> 40:45.450
your appreciation.

40:48.290 --> 40:49.760
You wronged him.

40:49.860 --> 40:51.490
You owe him an apology.

41:04.900 --> 41:06.280
Get up!

41:08.620 --> 41:10.080
Me?

41:15.050 --> 41:18.320
I'm OK. My legs are numb.

41:19.860 --> 41:21.230
I've kept you on your knees for so long

41:21.250 --> 41:23.400
out of no reason.

41:23.420 --> 41:24.320
Do you wonder

41:24.340 --> 41:25.760
why?

41:26.450 --> 41:28.840
I must have done something

41:28.860 --> 41:30.600
to upset you.

41:30.820 --> 41:32.370
What do you want?

41:37.730 --> 41:39.930
I can grant you a wish.

41:40.690 --> 41:42.600
What do you want?

41:45.490 --> 41:46.760
Really?

41:47.620 --> 41:49.370
Anything?

41:50.730 --> 41:52.080
Just say it.

41:56.690 --> 41:57.970
Dad.

41:59.530 --> 42:01.280
I want to

42:01.940 --> 42:03.650
play Pai Gow with you.

42:11.100 --> 42:12.930
Play Pai Gow?

42:14.050 --> 42:15.970
Dad, we should play with money.

42:23.010 --> 42:26.280
Fine. Wait for me in the hall.

42:26.420 --> 42:27.600
OK.

42:32.860 --> 42:34.210
There's one more thing.

42:36.420 --> 42:38.730
You must release Teng Zijing.

42:40.660 --> 42:42.320
He had a record

42:42.690 --> 42:44.190
in the Ministry of Penalty

42:44.210 --> 42:46.370
and he came back to the capital with you.

42:46.940 --> 42:49.120
I'm afraid he's up to something.

42:49.140 --> 42:50.560
He's my friend.

42:52.580 --> 42:55.130
It's too extravagant

42:55.380 --> 42:57.240
to have a friend in the capital city.

43:22.400 --> 43:25.980
In the river of history,

43:26.000 --> 43:29.470
time goes round and round.

43:32.280 --> 43:35.620
Memories about the former and present lives

43:35.640 --> 43:39.710
join each other in an endless way.

43:41.600 --> 43:44.220
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:44.240 --> 43:46.480
one season follows another in a flash,

43:46.480 --> 43:48.980
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:49.000 --> 43:50.600
I just can't give up

43:50.600 --> 43:53.940
to be with you for my whole life.

43:53.960 --> 43:59.430
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:00.680 --> 44:03.230
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:03.520 --> 44:05.560
Year after year in the wandering,

44:05.560 --> 44:08.220
I count the remaining years.

44:08.240 --> 44:10.420
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:10.440 --> 44:12.430
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:12.720 --> 44:15.110
I never feel regretful.

44:15.160 --> 44:16.520
In such a chaotic world,

44:16.520 --> 44:19.500
I still miss you as ever.

44:19.520 --> 44:22.470
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:22.760 --> 44:24.820
With a gentle heart,

44:24.840 --> 44:27.500
I cherish our remaining years.

44:27.520 --> 44:29.040
Even though we have to go through

44:29.040 --> 44:31.550
all the hardships along the journey,

44:31.680 --> 44:38.870
you always stay by my side,

44:38.960 --> 44:41.630
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:41.920 --> 44:44.000
Year after year in the wandering,

44:44.000 --> 44:46.660
I count the remaining years.

44:46.680 --> 44:48.820
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:48.840 --> 44:51.070
even though we end up the destiny,

44:51.280 --> 44:53.460
I never feel regretful.

44:53.480 --> 44:54.880
In such a chaotic world,

44:54.880 --> 44:57.940
I still miss you as ever.

44:57.960 --> 45:01.070
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:01.160 --> 45:03.300
With a gentle heart,

45:03.320 --> 45:06.020
I cherish our remaining years.

45:06.040 --> 45:07.480
Even though we have to go through

45:07.480 --> 45:10.140
all the hardships along the journey,

45:10.160 --> 45:18.920
you always stay by my side...
